                    "sense_definition": "A display of behavior intended to impress others, often seen as unnatural or insincere.",
                    "learner_level": "C1",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "deception",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "She was a simple woman without a hint of <w>pretense</w>."
